Darren Breeze <dbhk@hk.super.net> wrote:
: Any news on the release of a new version of the seti ev5 client for
: Linux / Alpha ??

I believe that the chap doing the Linux port has given up.

: My 21164 / 500 is turning out the same times as a 333mhz G3 Mac at the
