If you use ISO9660 format to burn a CD from files, the filenames will change,
because ISO9660 can not recognize long names. However, if you are create the CD
from an image file, that is different. All the information in the image will be
copied to the CD without any change. That is the meaning of  a image.
So you need not worry about that.

