Hi, to use single mode, just add single to your boot command. i.e.
milo>boot  hda2:vmlinux.gz  root=/dev/hda2 single    (in milo)

If you can add another hard disk in which linux has been installed, you can load
that
Linux, mount the original hard disk partitions, then erase /etc/passwd or the
shadowed one.

Wish you luck!

