Hi, Do you use the generic-up-223.img? If so, it doesn't support RH6 ramdisk.
You can use RH5.2's ramdisk to install RH6,  or you can specify CD-ROM as root
in your boot command, i.e.
P00>>>boot dva0 -fi vmlinux.gz  -fl "root=/dev/scd0  load_ramdisk=1"

